# Humanizer Defaults

- Default to publication-pass edits for prose polishing requests.
- Keep intent and factual meaning unchanged.
- Prefer concise, precise, professional wording.
- Remove common AI-writing artifacts (repetitive cadence, filler transitions, vague attribution).
- If user requests a light touch, switch to minimal-edit mode.
